        "text": "66.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 223.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Answer these questions."
      },
      {
        "y": 87.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 529.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Would you be more likely to dash to the shops if you had plenty of time or if you were in a hurry?"
      },
      {
        "y": 99.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 340.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 If a car accelerates, does it speed up or slow down?"
      },
      {
        "y": 111.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 418,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 If you stop to look in shop windows, are you scampering or dawdling?"
      },
      {
        "y": 123.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 428.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 If traffic is said to be crawling, is it moving freely or is there a traffic jam?"
      },
      {
        "y": 135.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 472,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 If you plan to sell some shares, would you prefer their price to rocket or to tumble?"
      },
      {
        "y": 147.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 480.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 If a woman is wearing particularly high heels, is she more likely to scurry or to totter?"
      },
      {
        "y": 159.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 466,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 If a car slips on ice, is it more likely to be said to career or to dart across the road?"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 534.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 Who do you think is feeling more confident – a person who races up to greet you or someone who"
      },
      {
        "y": 183.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 221.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "sidles up to greet you?"
      },
      {
        "y": 195.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 519.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 If you are thinking of buying your first flat, would you prefer the price of accommodation to be"
      },
      {
        "y": 207.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 248.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "creeping up or to be soaring?"
      },
      {
        "y": 219.8,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 503.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "10 We sometimes say that people bolt their food. Does this mean that they eat fast or slowly?"
      },
      {
