      },
      {
        "y": 412.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 383.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Which do you think is the best verb to fill each of these gaps?"
      },
      {
        "y": 429.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 507.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 When the car suddenly swerved to avoid hitting the dog, it out of control and"
      },
      {
        "y": 441.4,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 207.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "crashed into a tree."
      },
      {
        "y": 453.4,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 433.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A popped B bolted C careered D dashed"
      },
      {
        "y": 466.1,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 520.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 When she switched the bathroom light on, she was horrified to catch a glimpse of cockroaches"
      },
      {
        "y": 478.1,
        "x0": 186.5,
        "x1": 304.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "away into cracks in the tiles."
      },
      {
        "y": 490.1,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 435,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A plummeting B scuttling C creeping D nipping"
      },
      {
        "y": 502.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 452.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 I’m going to into town in my lunch hour. Can I get you anything?"
      },
      {
        "y": 514.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 417.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A bolt B plunge C totter D nip"
      },
      {
        "y": 527.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 413.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 If you don’t , you’ll miss the bus and be late for school."
      },
      {
        "y": 539.5,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 425.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A accelerate B rocket C speed up D crawl"
      },
      {
        "y": 552.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 435.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Meena’s spirits when she learnt that she had won first prize."
      },
      {
        "y": 564.2,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 420.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A plunged B soared C zipped D tore"
      },
      {
