        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 Richard into the house, trying hard not to wake his parents."
      },
      {
        "y": 638.4,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 450.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A soared B crept C scampered D accelerated"
      },
      {
        "y": 651.1,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 336.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 The dog suddenly out into the road."
      },
      {
        "y": 663.1,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 431.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A tottered B darted C plunged D soared"
      },
      {
